My bags are already full.
But I want some colour for my flat.
I go to a flower stall.
There are many flowers there.
I see very beautiful yellow flowers.
I take a large bunch.
The trader sees the bunch.
He immediately says: "That comes to twelve euros, please."
I have no small change.
I give him a twenty-euro note.
He counts the change into my hand.
"Eight euros back," he says.
He gives me a five-euro note.
Then he counts three coins: "One, two, three."
"Thank you very much and have a nice weekend!" he says.
"Thank you, you too," I answer.
The flowers smell really wonderful.
